---

## Key Learning

Servers with exceptionally long uptimes can gradually experience reduced performance due to accumulated resource inefficiencies, even when no 
hardware faults are present. Periodic maintenance reboots, performed during approved maintenance windows, help refresh system resources, 
improve overall stability, and prevent recurring performance-related alerts.
